<title>DENMARK: Denmark's KommuneKredit raises bond by 50 mln DKK.</title>
<headline>Denmark's KommuneKredit raises bond by 50 mln DKK.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Denmark's KommuneKredit has raised the amount of an existing four percent bond, due in 2004, by 50 million crowns to a total 466.85 million crowns, arranger Gudme Raaschou said in a statement on Tuesday.</p>
<p>It added that the additional bonds had been sold. --Steve Weizman, Copenhagen newsroom +45 33969650</p>
</text>
